 "text": "On December first the first transport plane landed on the half-finished strip. Over the following days aircraft lifted out more than four thousand wounded and frostbitten men. They flew in ammunition and medical supplies. They flew in replacements. For the men surrounded on that plateau the sound of those engines meant hope.",
